ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→乃木坂に入ってから食べてみようと思って食べてて気づいたら食べれるようになってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○トランプでなにが一番すき⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→神経衰弱！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○柚菜ちゃんシュークリーム好きそうって言われるやろ？てか大好きって顔に書いてあるもん。バレバレよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ゆなシュークリームすきだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○まだ抹茶は苦手？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→苦手〜〜（ ; ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○握手会とかで緊張するとどうしても敬語になっちゃうんですが、完全にタメで話すのは馴れ馴れしすぎますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そんなことないよ！ 逆にタメの方が話しやすくてすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○柚菜ちゃんは何鍋が好き？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ふつうの鍋！おばあちゃんが作るやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○握手に何回くらい行けばゆんちゃんに覚えてもらえるかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→顔は1回か2回で覚える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ゆんちゃんの家のクローゼットが異世界に通じています。さて、どんな世界でしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→これ凄く憧れてた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"